    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093520/extras/696e80e7662b174f676593304d04062e.poster.avif?t=1730068359\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093520/extras/696e80e7662b174f676593304d04062e.webm?t=1730068359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093520/extras/696e80e7662b174f676593304d04062e.mp4?t=1730068359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Overview</strong><br>Use dice to defeat your enemies, and customize each individual side as you progress!<br><br><strong>Gameplay</strong><br>You start with 2 dice but can end up with 4. Each dice has 6 sides which can be customized throughout the run.<br>Abilities such as Attack, Block and Gold can be rolled during battles, which is turn-based.<br>After each battle you gain some rewards, then enter the shop where you can strengthen your build before continuing to the next battle.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093520/extras/16c2d9cc5ead2acc4dc713151b7a05d5.poster.avif?t=1730068359\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093520/extras/16c2d9cc5ead2acc4dc713151b7a05d5.webm?t=1730068359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093520/extras/16c2d9cc5ead2acc4dc713151b7a05d5.mp4?t=1730068359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 5 playable characters<br></li><li> Design your own characters<br></li><li> Simple 1 minute tutorial<br></li><li> 3 Stages<br></li><li> 7 battles per Stage including boss fights<br></li><li> 15 unique abilities<br></li><li> 40+ Tokens (relics)</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093520/extras/696e80e7662b174f676593304d04062e.poster.avif?t=1730068359\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093520/extras/696e80e7662b174f676593304d04062e.webm?t=1730068359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093520/extras/696e80e7662b174f676593304d04062e.mp4?t=1730068359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Overview</strong><br>Use dice to defeat your enemies, and customize each individual side as you progress!<br><br><strong>Gameplay</strong><br>You start with 2 dice but can end up with 4. Each dice has 6 sides which can be customized throughout the run.<br>Abilities such as Attack, Block and Gold can be rolled during battles, which is turn-based.<br>After each battle you gain some rewards, then enter the shop where you can strengthen your build before continuing to the next battle.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093520/extras/16c2d9cc5ead2acc4dc713151b7a05d5.poster.avif?t=1730068359\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093520/extras/16c2d9cc5ead2acc4dc713151b7a05d5.webm?t=1730068359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093520/extras/16c2d9cc5ead2acc4dc713151b7a05d5.mp4?t=1730068359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 5 playable characters<br></li><li> Design your own characters<br></li><li> Simple 1 minute tutorial<br></li><li> 3 Stages<br></li><li> 7 battles per Stage including boss fights<br></li><li> 15 unique abilities<br></li><li> 40+ Tokens (relics)</li></ul>",
